// Title: Unexpected shutdowns and reboots
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: Event
// When to use: After a Node Down alert clears: was it a crash, a power event, or a planned restart?
// Tune: 6008 = previous shutdown was unexpected. 41 = Kernel-Power, rebooted without clean shutdown. 1074 = planned, who and why.

Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where EventLog == "System" and EventID in (6008, 41, 1074)
| extend Kind = case(EventID == 1074, "Planned", "Unexpected")
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Kind, EventID, Source, RenderedDescription
| order by TimeGenerated desc
